(
    title: "Pleiades",
    description: Some("Your missile launcher guards a sector of Earth in three scenes. Red Raiders swoop in from both sides, and a remote-controlled one trails an electro-magnetic ray that blocks your shots until you break it apart. Then comes their mother ship: hold fire until the cross in its rotating engine passes the open vent. Last, thread a minefield of bombs and exploding planes."),
